Subject: [PATCH 8/8] relax std: LazyCell and LazyLock give `&mut T` (DerefMut,
 force_mut)

krilla keeps a PDF writer in a `LazyCell` and calls a `&mut self` method on it
from a second lazy closure. Without `DerefMut` the capture analysis of that
closure stopped with "capture analysis incomplete: unresolved DerefMut
obligation", the one function of the Octos pptx skill that did not compile.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>
